      "age_basis_detail": "The lower cores are correlated with late Hirnantian strata using acritarchs and chitinozoans; cores 2–8 are assigned to the latest Hirnantian, with earliest Rhuddanian not excluded, chiefly using chitinozoans. The spore assemblage is assigned to sub-zone β of the Imperfectotriletes Interval Biozone, with a reported maximum range of Hirnantian to early Aeronian.",
